Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
V5: under kay\[CloseCurlyQuote]s suggestion, I try to make it faster by using \
Replace[] with specified level of action. 
Also, I want to allow the program to freely choose the order of contraction. \
So, I will no longer use the routine InteractingAction[] \
\>", "Subtitle",
