Cell["\<\
Now, I would like to add the \[Psi]\[Chi] interaction vertex. However, I \
would like to let the program \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]decide freely\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] where and when to use it.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963023363951586*^9, 
  3.9630234096684494`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"52e296cb-7cbb-1f43-87c0-\
ad891ffa8475"],

